Package: masc
Title: Simulate the Multi-Attribute Search and Choice (MASC) Model
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Kiante", "Fernandez", , "kiantefernan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8493-880X"))
Description: Implements functions to simulate multi-attribute decision making using 
    the MASC model (Gluth, Deakin, & Rieskamp, 2024). Provides tools for simulating 
    information search, belief updating, and choice behavior in multi-attribute decisions.
